{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t烏克蘭總統澤連斯基提議，將烏克蘭戰時狀態和總動員延長90天。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n根據烏克蘭議會「最高拉達」官網發布的消息，澤連斯基當地星期二遞交法令草案，提議將烏克蘭國家戰時狀態從10月31日延長至2027年1月29日。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n烏克蘭國家通訊社報道，自2022年初俄烏衝突升級以來，烏克蘭議會已經先後20次批准延長國家戰時狀態。\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T12:40:59.117580+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T12:00:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T16:58:33.483495+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T12:38:30.488229+00:00","content_hash":"ae3215957ce461f9170b4b3eef081f175c04a5b2669b6869b6021c88476141bf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}